{"slug":"news/wellbeing-research-grants","title":"Funding better evaluations of AI’s impact on wellbeing \\ Anthropic","desc":"Anthropic is launching a $5 million grant program to fund independent research into how AI impacts users’ wellbeing.","main":"<div class=\"\"><article class=\"EaEYjq_Article\" style=\"opacity:1\"><header class=\"VYxBBq_Header\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"VYxBBq_Content\"><h1 class=\"VYxBBq_Title\">Funding better evaluations of AI’s impact on wellbeing</h1></div><div class=\"VYxBBq_MetalistContainer\" style=\"--metalist-columns:3\"><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Metalist\"><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Published</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-25\">Aug 25, 2026</time></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Category</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/news/announcements\">Announcements</a></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Topics</p><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Wrap\"><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=wellbeing\">Wellbeing</a></li><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=funding\">Funding</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_ThirdTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=benchmarks\">Benchmarks</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=safeguards\">Safeguards</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=open-source\">Open source</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=measurement-and-mitigation\">Measurement and mitigation</a></li></ul><button class=\"VYxBBq_TopicSeeMore text-caption-1\">See more...</button></li></ul></div></header><div class=\"E